hysics. This collection is known as the \"Grand Unified Field Theories.\""},"tableOfContents":{"@type":"Contents","#text":"The mystery of being -- The rule of law -- What is reality? -- Alternative histories -- The theory of everything -- Choosing our universe -- The apparent miracle -- The grand design."},"note":[{"@type":"statement of responsibility","#text":"Stephen Hawking and Leonard Mlodinow."},"Includes index.",{"@type":"bibliography","#text":"Includes index."}],"subject":[{"@authority":"lcsh","topic":"Unified field theories"},{"@authority":"lcsh","topic":"Mathematical physics"},{"@authority":"lcsh","topic":"Superstring theories"}],"classification":[{"@authority":"lcc","#text":"QC20.5 .H379 2010"},{"@authority":"nlm","#text":"530.142 H392g"},{"@edition":"22","@authority":"ddc","#text":"530.1/42"}],"identifier":[{"@type":"isbn","#text":"9780553805376 :"},{"@type":"isbn","#text":"0553805371"},{"@type":"oclc","#text":"654183639"}],"relatedItem":{"@otherType":"HOLLIS record","location":{"url":"https://id.lib.harvard.edu/alma/990125884370203941/catalog"}},"location":[{"physicalLocation":{"@displayLabel":"Harvard repository","@type":"repository","@valueURI":"http://isni.org/isni/0000000121705139","#text":"Harvard Divinity School Library, Harvard University"},"shelfLocator":"  QC20.5     .H379 2010  "},{"physicalLocation":{"@displayLabel":"Harvard repository","@type":"repository","@valueURI":"http://isni.org/isni/000000046073724X","#text":"Cabot Science Library, Harvard University"},"shelfLocator":"QC20.5 .H379 2010"},{"physicalLocation":{"@displayLabel":"Harvard repository","@type":"repository","@valueURI":"http://id.loc.gov/rwo/agents/no2014094889","#text":"Widener Library, Harvard University"},"shelfLocator":"QC20.5 .H379 2010"},null,null],"extension":[{"librarycloud":{"HarvardRepositories":{"HarvardRepository":["Cabot Science","Divinity Library","Widener"]},"originalDocument":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/harvard.librarycloud.marc/990125884370203941","priorrecordids